### A2A Hello World example — HTTP source on port 9000
### POST /sources/invoices/events

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:9000/health

###

### Insert invoice inv-1001 (ADD → SendMessage to Hello World)
POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/sources/invoices/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "insert",
  "element": {
    "type": "node",
    "id": "inv-1001",
    "labels": ["Invoice"],
    "properties": {
      "invoiceId": "inv-1001",
      "customer": "Acme",
      "amount": 1250.5
    }
  }
}

###

### Update amount (Hello World already completed → new SendMessage)
POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/sources/invoices/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "update",
  "element": {
    "type": "node",
    "id": "inv-1001",
    "labels": ["Invoice"],
    "properties": {
      "invoiceId": "inv-1001",
      "customer": "Acme",
      "amount": 1800.0
    }
  }
}

###

### Delete (terminal task → Drop, not CancelTask)
POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/sources/invoices/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "delete",
  "id": "inv-1001",
  "labels": ["Invoice"]
}
